  "suggested_language": "\"Cardholder\" means any natural person or entity authorized by the Client to use the Cards issued to the Client, including the Client themselves.",
  "rationale": "This change simplifies the definition, making it clearer who qualifies as a 'Cardholder', thus reducing potential ambiguity and disputes."
}

{
  "clause_name": "DEFINITIONS",
  "issue": "Inconsistent and unclear definitions may lead to ambiguity in interpretation.",
  "suggested_language": "\u201cCard Data\u201d means the numbers or identifiers associated with a Card or Account. \u201cCardholder Data\u201d means all data and information, including Personal Data, related to each Consumer Cardholder. \u201cConsumer Cardholder\u201d means a Cardholder who is a natural person, or such person\u2019s authorized users of Cards. \u201cConsumer Transaction Data\u201d means any data, excluding Cardholder Data, used in or generated by the provision of Services in connection with Cards issued to Consumer Cardholders. \u201cPersonal Data\u201d means any information that can be used, directly or indirectly, alone or in combination with other information, to identify an individual.",
  "rationale": "The improved language ensures clarity and consistency in definitions, reducing the potential for misinterpretation and ensuring that all parties have a clear understanding of the terms used throughout the contract."
}

